[{:db/id "q-37266/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "26aac073-2784-58ce-b700-7e1c19837fa3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "cd3a8c3a-e696-5f0c-b5e6-9b1175806bfe" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "ef591ac2-93a9-56e6-b3fd-00d41596e791" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "befdbb84-b438-57ae-a9e0-f82275e43739" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "85632a57-e55d-5287-bf45-c249e78e95fd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a88c1383-2eeb-507a-a204-683c877bbf7c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-37266/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer-field/choices ["q-37266/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-37266/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-37266/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-37266/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-37266/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-37266" :question/id #uuid "fb98e8f1-5ed6-502a-b031-26657626ffd8" :question/math-academy-id "q-37266" :question/problem "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A={3,6,9,12,15,18,21,…}?$\n\n- $B={3n:n\\in N,1\\le n\\le 4}$\n- $C={6n:n\\in N,1\\le n\\le 3}$\n- $D={2n:n\\in N,1\\le n\\le 4}$" :question/worked-solution "First, we must find the elements of the sets $B,C$ and $D.$\n\n- We find the elements of the set $B$ substituting the values $n\\in {1,2,3,4}$ into the formula $3n,$ and we get the following elements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n=1 & \\,⇒\\,3(1)=3 \\\\ n=2 & \\,⇒\\,3(2)=6 \\\\ n=3 & \\,⇒\\,3(3)=9 \\\\ n=4 & \\,⇒\\,3(4)=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have, $B={3,6,9,12}.$\n\n- On the other hand, the elements of the set $C$ can be found substituting the values $n\\in {1,2,3}$ into the formula $6n,$ and we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n=1 & \\,⇒\\,6(1)=6 \\\\ n=2 & \\,⇒\\,6(2)=12 \\\\ n=3 & \\,⇒\\,6(3)=18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $C={6,12,18}.$\n\n- Finally, the elements of the set $D$ can be found substituting the values $n\\in {1,2,3,4}$ into the formula $2n,$ and we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n=1 & \\,⇒\\,2(1)=2 \\\\ n=2 & \\,⇒\\,2(2)=4 \\\\ n=3 & \\,⇒\\,2(3)=6 \\\\ n=4 & \\,⇒\\,2(4)=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have, $D={2,4,6,8}.$\n\nNow, a set is a subset of $A$ if all of its elements are also elements of $A.$ With that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- $B={3,6,9,12}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- $C={6,12,18}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- $D={2,4,6,8}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $2\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-37266/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0e5efaa-e624-5045-abdb-cdf8d32ad6cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-37266"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-37264/selection/823b02fc025c074b9ccf6e807bfb2d2159dff99582b22a50c6d18a689d890d3a" :answer/id #u