erate :question/answer-fields ["q-80808/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3cbddaef-3828-5454-b892-26a3c6242ddb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80808"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-80809"] :question/worked-solution "To find every subset of $U,$ we list out every combination of elements within $U.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071627/assets/b0e483a2d10cba17fb2bd3bf0e78d7b4d2fc07b22dbb5c492564b998bbfce6fc.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n∅,{-\\pi },{\\pi },{-\\pi ,\\pi }.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-104925"] :question/worked-solution "To find every subset of $A,$ we list out every combination of elements within $A.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071627/assets/bb31e2bd632f39706b2785ce6cab764673997fe77b8a9417f7dc213cdff4b7a7.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set, since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n∅,{0},{1},{0,1}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-80829/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "0129e1d7-6042-563d-a3fe-1ac8f1ca778a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80829/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "35d86247-b147-56c7-88a6-73eae54f88f1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80829/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "d83ab36c-4ac8-5999-82d9-6f42dc4d4f72" :answer/type